    family-names: Vasylenko
repository-code: "local: nanochat-cwc-baseline (fork of karpathy/nanochat)"
version: "1.0.0-526c6a5"
date-released: "2026-07-16"
license: MIT
abstract: >
  A verified measurement substrate and falsification harness for causally
  validating adaptive-computation mechanisms. Contains one narrowed positive
  (routing under value distillation), one clean positive (adaptive-compute
  Jensen gap = P(m>K)), several preserved negatives, and a unifying
  identifiability theory. Not yet a proven Pareto-superior architecture.
